       01  BUF-RSLTLOG.
           03  RSLTLOG-STATUS-FLAG      PIC X(01)    VALUE SPACE.
           03  RSLTLOG-MESSAGE          PIC X(80)    VALUE SPACE.
           03  RSLTLOG-CIF-RECORD       PIC X(300)   VALUE SPACE.
           03  RSLTLOG-CIF-RECORD-R1 REDEFINES RSLTLOG-CIF-RECORD.
               05  RSLTLOG-VEND-CODE    PIC X(10).
               05  RSLTLOG-CORP-CODE    PIC X(10).
               05  RSLTLOG-PLNT-CODE    PIC X(04).
               05  RSLTLOG-MFGR-NAME    PIC X(50).
               05  RSLTLOG-MFGR-PART    PIC X(50).
               05  RSLTLOG-VEND-PART    PIC X(50).
               05  RSLTLOG-VEND-AUXID   PIC X(50).
               05  RSLTLOG-VEND-PRCE    PIC S9(11)V9999 COMP-3.
               05  RSLTLOG-VEND-PRCUM   PIC X(02).
               05  RSLTLOG-VEND-CURCD   PIC X(02).
           03  RSLTLOG-DATE-TIME        PIC X(14)    VALUE SPACE.
